      "date": "2026-11-26 14:54:13.000000000",
      "message": "Patch Set 4:\n\n(1 comment)\n\nAI code review results below, please doublecheck\n\nLooks good; the setup/cleanup ordering now matches the lifetime of ldlm_granted_total. One optional nit inline for whenever the patch is next refreshed, no need to re-spin for it. A regression test is hard to make deterministic for a setup-time race, so this is optional: a fail_loc delay just before ldlm_reclaim_setup(), plus a concurrent `lctl get_param ldlm.lock_granted_count` during module load, would cover the race.",
