        "subject": "LU-19824 ldlm: publish sysfs attributes after setup",
        "message": "LU-19824 ldlm: publish sysfs attributes after setup\n\nReading lock_granted_count before its per-CPU counter is initialized\ncan crash. Register the LDLM attributes only after setup completes,\nand remove them before cleanup destroys the counter. Removing the\nattributes drains active readers before their backing state is freed.\n\nFixes: 33b55f223a42 (\"LU-6529 ldlm: improve proc interface of lock reclaim\")\nSigned-off-by: Timothy Day <timday@thelustrecollective.com>\nAssisted-by: Codex:gpt-6.1-sol\nSigned-off-by: Patrick Farrell <patrick@thelustrecollective.com>\nChange-Id: I3a4690e25cdfc13b419c72287a94562a4a2051ed\n"
